! Copy Part Number: defines the HELION_COPY_PART_NUMBER and HELION_COPY_PART_NAME buttons and puts
! them in the Edit menu, just below Copy. helion_copy_part_number.py adds the same buttons to the
! right-click menu of assembly components. They run copy_part_number.py and copy_part_name.py.
!
! Install-Copy-Part-Number.bat writes this file to %LOCALAPPDATA%\Siemens\NX2506\startup, where NX
! reads it at startup, with the full path of each script filled in on its ACTIONS line.
VERSION 120

EDIT UG_GATEWAY_MAIN_MENUBAR

AFTER UG_EDIT_COPY
  BUTTON HELION_COPY_PART_NUMBER
  LABEL Copy Part &Number
  MESSAGE Copies the part number (item ID) of the selected components to the clipboard.
  BITMAP copy
  ACTIONS @COPY_PART_NUMBER_SCRIPT@

  BUTTON HELION_COPY_PART_NAME
  LABEL Copy Part N&ame
  MESSAGE Copies the part name (item name) of the selected components to the clipboard.
  BITMAP copy
  ACTIONS @COPY_PART_NAME_SCRIPT@
END_OF_AFTER
